        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1648675503375814656",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "五、正常行情震荡时\n可根据以上权重阶梯挂单，\n考虑最大化收益，\n分批挂单1%-4%振幅，\n分别权重为36%、32%、21%、9%\n每下跌1%建仓1份，\n每上涨1%减仓1份。\n\n当波动变大时\n应改变衰减因子，\n扩大各振幅收益，\n如衰减因子设定为1，\n对应权重为0.143、0.190、0.190、0.143、0.079、0.071、0.028、0.032",
      "url": "https://x.com/iiiinvest/status/1691326663936917504"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1589763597705437184",
      "conversation_id": "1648675503375814656",
      "created_at": "2023-08-15T05:49:54.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1691326329428619264"
      ],
      "id": "1691326329428619264",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "1589763597705437184",
      "lang": "zh",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 271,
        "like_count": 0,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1648675503375814656",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "四、10%=0.5*-4%*4%= -0.08%\n\n计算得出各振幅权重为：0.3693、0.3240、0.2123、0.0949、0.0223、0.0223、0.0006、0.0006、0.0006 和 0.0447",
      "url": "https://x.com/iiiinvest/status/1691326329428619264"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1589763597705437184",
      "conversation_id": "1648675503375814656",
